# Motion film render output (scripts/motion-src renders into these; the
# committed artifact lives in public/assets/motion/). The glob covers every
# scratch variant a spike needs (dist-motion-j1, dist-motion-baseline, ...)
# without ever letting a few hundred PNGs into a commit.
dist-motion*/

# Brand fonts staged by scripts/motion-src/render.mjs at render time (copied
# from the build output; never committed)
scripts/motion-src/*.woff2

# External study clones vendored into the visual-directions workspace for
# reference only. Their license notices live in external/LICENSES.md; the two
# anthropic SKILL.md reference files stay tracked.
design-studies/visual-directions/external/iso-topology/
design-studies/visual-directions/external/codemap/
